# Control-node toolchain — THE single source of truth for local + CI.
# Standard asdf `.tool-versions` format, read natively by BOTH asdf and mise:
#   mise install     # or: asdf install
# With shell activation the pinned tools are selected when you enter the repo.
# CI installs the SAME set via `jdx/mise-action`, so local == CI.
#
# `ansible-core` has no asdf plugin: mise resolves it through its pypi backend
# (an isolated venv). Collections are pinned separately in
# requirements.yml. Lint tools (ansible-lint / yamllint) are
# intentionally NOT pinned here — they are "latest"-tracked and installed via
# pip/pipx by the operator / CI (outside `make install`).
python 3.11.15
ansible-core 2.19.11
